    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "6C45367949483D43",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Sevaro, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "6C45357949483B90",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous affronter Éra, la Nymphe\\nPâtissière et Championne de cette Arène ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "6C453879494840A9",
      "text": "Dans ce cas, veuillez me suivre, je vous prie.\\nJe vais vous conduire sur le terrain de combat.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "6C45377949483EF6",
      "text": "Très bien, n’hésitez pas à revenir me voir dès\\nque vous serez prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_entry_01",
      "hash64": "646E2CD7DF034FC2",
      "text": "Mange à ta faim, surtout, mon petit Prismillon\\nd’amour...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_poke_entry_01",
      "hash64": "65F00449FA87129F",
      "text": "Prismi !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "873EDBF65FF9575F",
      "text": "Tiens, tiens, mais quel[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]le Dresseu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]rse à l’allure\\nravissante nous avons là ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "873EDCF65FF95912",
      "text": "Merci beaucoup d’avoir participé au Roule-Olive.\\nTa technique était impeccable ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "873EDDF65FF95AC5",
      "text": "Oh, mais, c’est vrai ! J’ai oublié de me présenter ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "873ED6F65FF94EE0",
      "text": "Je suis Éra, la cheffe pâtissière de\\nl’établissement Pâtisse en Boule.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "873ED7F65FF95093",
      "text": "Oh là là... Excuse-moi, c’est vrai que nous ne\\nsommes pas dans ma pâtisserie, là...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "873ED8F65FF95246",
      "text": "Je suis désolée. Je patauge un peu dans\\nle caramel. Laisse-moi recommencer !\\r\\nJe suis Éra, la Championne de cette Arène.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "873ED9F65FF953F9",
      "text": "C’est que... je passe davantage de temps à faire\\ndes gâteaux à la pâtisserie qu’à me battre ici.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "873EE2F65FF96344",
      "text": "Pour moi, les gâteaux sont comme les Pokémon\\nInsecte qui se cachent parmi les plantes.\\c\\nIls sont petits, mais renferment un grand pouvoir.\\nEn l’occurrence, celui de nous rendre heureux ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "873EE3F65FF964F7",
      "text": "Alors, j’espère que tu aimes le sucre et que\\ntu n’as pas peur des piqûres d’insectes,\\r\\nparce qu’ici tu vas avoir droit aux deux à la fois ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "874260F65FFC6F35",
      "text": "C’est incroyable... Ta force n’a pas cessé\\nde gonfler, comme un bon soufflé au four...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "87425FF65FFC6D82",
      "text": "Je crois que moi aussi, j’aurais bien besoin\\nde développer mes techniques de combat...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "87425EF65FFC6BCF",
      "text": "En tout cas, c’est encore un succès pour toi,\\nbien joué !\\c\\nVoici le Badge de l’Arène qui te permettra\\nde prouver que tu m’as vaincue ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_16",
      "hash64": "87425AF65FFC6503",
      "text": "Et tu sais ce qui rendrait cette victoire\\nencore plus délicieuse ? La savourer\\r\\navec une de mes spécialités pâtissières ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge",
      "hash64": "03E0CD0DB4E5B087",
      "text": "Voyons, tu as donc [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Badge[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s d’Arène, désormais.\\nTu pourras attraper des Pokémon jusqu’au\\r\\nniveau [VAR 0x0201(0002)] plus facilement, et ils t’obéiront.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_badge_all",
      "hash64": "7357E0542B75F0CB",
      "text": "Tu as donc huit Badges d’Arène, désormais.\\nTu pourras attraper n’importe quels Pokémon\\r\\net ils t’obéiront tous parfaitement ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_waza",
      "hash64": "54D7588FA1FEE21D",
      "text": "Je sens que tu as l’appétit vorace !\\nAlors voilà une CT pour toi ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "87425DF65FFC6A1C",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, je ne sais pas si tu es au courant,\\nmais grâce à la Machine à CT, tu peux recréer\\r\\nles CT que tu as obtenues durant tes aventures ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "87425CF65FFC6869",
      "text": "J’espère qu’avec ça, le chemin qu’il te reste à\\nparcourir sera un peu plus doux et savoureux.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_mushi_15",
      "hash64": "87425BF65FFC66B6",
      "text": "À une prochaine fois ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mushi_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "6C453A794948440F",
      "text": "Vous avez triomphé de l’Arène de Sevaro.\\nFélicitations !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
